#: ../../../userspace-api/landlock:49: ../include/uapi/linux/landlock.h:116
msgid ""
"Because logging is only suppressed by a layer if the layer denies access, a "
"sandboxed program cannot use this flag to \"hide\" access denials, without "
"denying itself the access in the first place."
