#: ../../../userspace-api/landlock:605: ../include/uapi/linux/landlock.h:264
msgid ""
"A Landlock rule with port 0 and the ``LANDLOCK_ACCESS_NET_BIND_TCP`` or "
"``LANDLOCK_ACCESS_NET_BIND_UDP`` right means that requesting to bind on port "
"0 is allowed and it will automatically translate to binding on a kernel-"
"assigned ephemeral port."
